{
  "title": "Hearty Mustardy Korean Pork Stew",
  "description": "A tender and flavorful Korean stew featuring pork, mustard, and cider, made with ayurvedic-sattvic-friendly ingredients. This dish is perfect for a monsoon day.",
  "cuisine": "Korean",
